+/****************************************************************************
+ * Name: heapinfo_capture_backtrace
+ *
+ * Description:
+ *   Record up to (HEAPINFO_BACKTRACE_DEPTH - 1) application caller frames
+ *   (beyond the immediate caller stored in alloc_call_addr, backtrace
